<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tourism Webpage</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.0.0/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="tour.css">
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Tourism Webpage</a>
    </nav>
</header>
<main>
    <section class="places">
        <h2>Places to Visit</h2>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <img class="card-img-top" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="HIMACHAL">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title">HIMACHAL</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Himachal Pradesh is a state in the northern part of India. Situated in the Western Himalayas,it is one of the thirteen mountain states.</p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#himachalModal">View Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <img class="card-img-top" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="SHIMLA">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title">SHIMLA</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Shimla is the capital and the largest city of the northern Indian state of Himachal Pradesh.</p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#shimlaModal">View Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="col-md-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <img class="card-img-top" src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQXOHw6zvVDojh0CMc6eEQNq_Ml2WdbaQ5YnQ&s" alt="MANALI">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title">MANALI</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Manali is a resort town, near Kullu town in Kullu district in the Indian state of Himachal Pradesh. It is situated in the northern end of the Kullu Valley.</p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#manaliModal">View Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <img class="card-img-top" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="DARJEELING">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title">DARJEELING</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Darjeeling is a city in the northernmost region of the Indian state of West Bengal.Located in the Eastern Himalayas.</p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#darjeelingModal">View Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <img class="card-img-top" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="KASHMIR">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title">KASHMIR</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Kashmir's allure lies in its breathtaking valleys and the unassuming grace of its natural panorama.</p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#KashmirModal">View Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="card">
                    <img class="card-img-top" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="NEPAL">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title">NEPAL</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Nepal, officially the Federal Democratic Republic of Nepal, is a landlocked country in South Asia. It is mainly situated in the Himalayas.</p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#NepalModal">View Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
